    <div class="ab-hero__text">
      <h1>About the forum</h1>
      <p class="lede">A partnership of academics, researchers, state officers, community organisations and civil society, formed in February 2018 to give small-scale fishers a real voice in how their fisheries are governed.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="ab-hero__img">
      <img src="/assets/img/fgd-rekawa.webp" alt="State officers, researchers and community members in discussion at Rekawa" width="1000" height="664" fetchpriority="high">
    </figure>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="ab-figures" aria-label="The sector in figures">
  <div class="wrap">
    <dl class="ab-figures__row">
      <div><dt>2.7 million</dt><dd>people depend on fisheries</dd></div>
